@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『図書室』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_28_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛仔细搜寻图书室，<br>果然如她所料，找到了玛格。|#0103Adv11_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格躲在一个阴暗的角落里，<br>默默地看着书。<br>|#0103Adv11_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……哎呀，艾玛。|#0103Adv11_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格，那本书是……|#0103Adv11_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『魔女の本』表示
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:之前给你看过的吧？<br>是关于魔女和魔法的图解书。<br>最近我已经能读懂不少了。|#0103Adv11_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸！？真的吗！？|#0103Adv11_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊，只要找到规律，<br>其实并不难。艾玛要不要也试试看？|#0103Adv11_Margo003| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:呃……我对学习这种事，<br>不太擅长……|#0103Adv11_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，看起来确实是这样呢。<br>不过艾玛，我觉得你其实很聪明。<br>感觉你是在故意装作不行的样子。|#0103Adv11_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哪有……你太高看我了。|#0103Adv11_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:先、先不说这个了，<br>书里有写什么重要的内容吗？|#0103Adv11_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:这个嘛……|#0103Adv11_Margo005| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格爱惜地抚摸着书的书脊。<br>|#0103Adv11_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR4

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然不知道对我们来说是否是救赎，<br>但我发现书中写着某个仪式。|#0103Adv11_Margo006| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:仪式……？|#0103Adv11_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:是的。不过我还在解读中，<br>等多了解一些再告诉你吧。<br>|#0103Adv11_Margo007| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……还有就是，这座宅邸的某处似乎藏着<br>【杀死魔女的药】。|#0103Adv11_Margo008| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，杀死魔女的药……？|#0103Adv11_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:"是的。药物名称是【<ruby=\"Tredecim\">特雷德基姆</ruby>】，<br>这似乎是拉丁语中表示【13】的词。|#0103Adv11_Margo009|" AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这种药进入体内后，似乎会因副作用<br>在死后出现身体反应。|#0103Adv11_Margo010| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过这些信息我还在解读中，<br>等了解更多细节再告诉你。|#0103Adv11_Margo011| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:仔细观察玛格，<br>能发现她眼下有着明显的黑眼圈。|#0103Adv11_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（看来玛格也撑不住了啊……）|#0103Adv11_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR7

[PrintTextModified Text:来，艾玛你看。|#0103Adv11_Margo012| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格突然摘下手套，<br>伸出她那纤细而漂亮的手。<br>|#0103Adv11_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR7

[PrintTextModified Text:……？手怎么了吗？|#0103Adv11_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:指甲很长吧？<br>这还是昨天刚剪的呢。|#0103Adv11_Margo013| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:欸……|#0103Adv11_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到玛格的指尖，艾玛说不出话来。<br>这长度看着，确实不像是昨天才修剪过的。|#0103Adv11_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR5

[PrintTextModified Text:你应该很清楚看守……<br>也就是那些残骸是什么样子的吧？|#0103Adv11_Margo014| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看来魔女化加深时，<br>指甲生长也会加快呢。|#0103Adv11_Margo015| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:25 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格，你能感觉到魔女化有加深吗？<br>有……有杀人的冲动吗？|#0103Adv11_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当艾玛不由自主地后退时，<br>玛格微笑着摇了摇头。|#0103Adv11_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵，别害怕，我不会做什么的。<br>我还没到那个程度，<br>没有杀人的冲动。|#0103Adv11_Margo016| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊……太好了。|#0103Adv11_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，魔女化确实已经开始了。<br>我还发现了一些好处。|#0103Adv11_Margo017| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:好处？|#0103Adv11_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:魔法的效力变强了。<br>想必魔女化越深入，<br>就能使用越强大的魔法吧。|#0103Adv11_Margo018| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就像这本书上图解说明的那样。|#0103Adv11_Margo019| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:"（魔法变强或许是好事。<br>　但是……如果变成残骸失去了自我那就完蛋了）|#0103Adv11_Ema014|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:你还记得<br>蕾雅和安安的处刑吗？|#0103Adv11_Margo020| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……怎么可能忘记。|#0103Adv11_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们都是因为受到杀意驱使而犯下杀人罪，<br>以魔女的身份被处决。|#0103Adv11_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——然后，变成了【残骸】。|#0103Adv11_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（她们时常会出现在噩梦中……<br>　这也在折磨着我们……）|#0103Adv11_Ema016|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:不知道以后在哪个阶段，我们的身体会完全魔女化，<br>转变成不死的肉体呢。|#0103Adv11_Margo021| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们没有因处刑而死，<br>说明她们已经成为魔女了吧。|#0103Adv11_Margo022| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但外表却没有变化，<br>会不会是个人差异呢。|#0103Adv11_Margo023| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR2

[PrintTextModified Text:有的人外表会稍微带有异形的特征，<br>有的则保持原貌成为魔女了……|#0103Adv11_Margo024| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果能从外表判断就好了，<br>这样就能轻易隔离魔女了。|#0103Adv11_Margo025| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:隔离也太过分了……|#0103Adv11_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，我觉得这很合理哦？<br>比如说我，在这个阶段就应该被隔离。|#0103Adv11_Margo026| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:把有可能成为魔女的人关起来的话，<br>就不会发生凶杀案了。<br>从一开始就该这么做。|#0103Adv11_Margo027| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛皱眉摇头。|#0103Adv11_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:做不到……|#0103Adv11_Ema018| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你真是温柔呢。|#0103Adv11_Margo028| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但这种温柔有时也是种残酷。<br>你迟早会后悔的。|#0103Adv11_Margo029| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Determined2,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我不会后悔的！|#0103Adv11_Ema019| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一定会<br>和大家一起逃出这座监牢。|#0103Adv11_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:再也不会让任何人死去。|#0103Adv11_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0103Adv11_Margo030| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格用空洞的眼神，<br>面无表情地注视着艾玛。|#0103Adv11_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛说出口的漂亮话<br>似乎完全无法触动玛格的内心。|#0103Adv11_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（即便如此……即便如此，<br>　我也想要救玛格啊……）|#0103Adv11_Ema022|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:……玛格，<br>今天大家准备去野餐。|#0103Adv11_Ema023| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:如果可以的话，希望你也能来。<br>我想和大家一起开心地相处。|#0103Adv11_Ema024| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……哦。|#0103Adv11_Margo031| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格淡淡地说着，<br>漠不关心地将视线移回书本。|#0103Adv11_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我觉得我还是不去比较好。<br>说不定会对谁产生杀意。|#0103Adv11_Margo032| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……但是，但是，我们会等你的。|#0103Adv11_Ema025| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛转身离开。|#0103Adv11_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我们之间是有感情的。<br>　有感情的话，就不会发生凶杀案）|#0103Adv11_Ema026|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（——我想要这样相信）|#0103Adv11_Ema027| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛紧握拳头，<br>坚定地望着前方。|#0103Adv11_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

